  25 | GET | `/api/bookings[?date=YYYY-MM-DD]` | `200 {"bookings": [...]}`, sorted by date, start, room |
  26 | POST | `/api/bookings` | `201` with the new booking |
  27 | DELETE | `/api/bookings/<id>` | `204`, or `404 booking not found` |
